OL,3,AEx-OpenAI worker accused of planting
OL,4,Adevice had Saudi support, says court
OL,5,Afiling
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Saudi national charged with secretly
OL,8,Fplanting a recording device in one of
OL,9,FOpenAI's meeting rooms has been accused
OL,10,Fof having "considerable support" from
OL,11,Fthe Saudi government, according to a
OL,12,Fcourt filing in California.
OL,14,FUS prosecutors claimed Abdulrahman
OL,15,FAlfozan, who worked for the AI firm,
OL,16,Fwas in "frequent communication... with
OL,17,Fa member of the Saudi royal family",
OL,18,Fand say a member of the country's
OL,19,Fmilitary paid for a one-way flight to
OL,20,FSaudi Arabia for his wife and son after
OL,21,Fhis arrest.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
