OL,3,AEx-OpenAI worker accused of planting
OL,4,Adevice had Saudi support, says court
OL,5,Afiling
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 35-year-old engineer was on Monday
OL,8,Fdeemed a flight risk and denied bail,
OL,9,Fpending trial.
OL,11,FThe Saudi government did not
OL,12,Fimmediately respond to BBC requests for
OL,13,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
